OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with rain in the
OL,6,Fmorning, perhaps heavy in the east but
OL,7,Fdrier in the west. Turning drier in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon with bright spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping but also the chance of the
OL,10,Fodd shower. Windy at times,
OL,11,Fparticularly around the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will stay dry through the
OL,14,Fevening and overnight with some clear
OL,15,Fspells developing and winds falling
OL,16,Flight, but staying cloudier in the
OL,17,Fnorth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
