OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMostly dry with good bright
OL,6,For sunny spells and light winds,
OL,7,Fchance of the odd afternoon shower.
OL,8,FLikely cloudier with some rain over
OL,9,FFife later in the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFurther
OL,12,Frain or showers, occasionally heavy,
OL,13,Fbut also with some drier and brighter
OL,14,Fspells at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
